{"id":"716e9617-c3fb-441f-bef5-aec34f8fa541","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"ec7a1712f9fb8789","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/notes/comments.ts","baseline":{"blob":"64df81c4c482457e9b07b521d53796b46e69edfd","start":1,"end":91},"shape":{"type":"ExportDeclaration","atoms":["export","interface","Comment","{","\"","from","\"",":","number",";","\"","to","\"",":","number",";","\"","text","\"",":","string",";","\"","below","\"",":","number","}"]},"context":{"after":"56e6522f04cb47c9"}},"payload":{"text":"A comment as a note would take it (packages/editor/ARCHITECTURE.md, *Comments become notes*): a whole-line comment — a run\nof `//` lines, or a `/* … *\\/` block — its text off the markers, and the code just below it, which the note stands on.\nOne that's for a tool stays a comment: `eslint-disable`, `@ts-expect-error`, a license, a triple-slash reference.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:36:34.333Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:36:34.333Z"}
{"id":"92dac283-f39f-4a01-801a-8dedce1d758a","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"56e6522f04cb47c9","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/notes/comments.ts","baseline":{"blob":"dac5e1429acda01f7c5905bfc2e8155229c18b3f","start":564,"end":777},"shape":{"type":"VariableDeclaration","atoms":["const","FOR_TOOLS","=","/","^\\s*(?:eslint-(?:disable|enable)|@ts-(?:expect-error|ignore|nocheck|check)\\b|prettier-ignore|istanbul ignore|[cv]8 ignore|#__PURE__|webpackChunkName|global\\s)|@license|@preserve|\\bcopyright\\b","/","iu"]},"context":{"before":"ec7a1712f9fb8789","after":"c367f4b3f95f34de"}},"payload":{"text":"What a tool reads, kept as a comment: a directive, which starts the comment (prose may name one), or a license.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T16:36:11.583Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T16:36:11.583Z"}
